// An else-less `if` used as a VALUE in ARGUMENT position. `vl check` returns 0 and the
// emitter refuses with `emitProgram: if-expression requires an else arm` — clause 2, and a
// position the 2026-09-02 `T | null` ruling did not reach: `const x = if true { 1 }`, the
// `else if` chain, the f64 join and the in-function binding all run today.
// `ifExprRefKind` answers null for a bare numeric join, so `emitIfExprAs` gets an i32
// blocktype and `noElseNiche` refuses a node that is neither a nullable boolean nor a
// nullable literal union. The lowering exists; one delivery position never got it.
// Should print 1.
print(if true { 1 })
